  "lines": [
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "西桥刚收工。手冻得有点抖，让我把硬币数清楚。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-ceec2ea825ad",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-ceec2ea825ad.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "西桥养护通道。今晚在检查结冰情况。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-bb2455584b24",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-bb2455584b24.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "县养护队。我已经下班，没有进你们仓库的工作安排。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-58e10659eeb1",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-58e10659eeb1.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "昨晚雾大，路还通着。现在已经下雪，桥面会更滑。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-aa41530c8537",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-aa41530c8537.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-cb6b2b44d375.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-117307c80446.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-8a45852189e3.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-3fc93796a117.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-842e7be60d3c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-6ae7fbd636ba.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-b89af97da100.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "门口的路我走不惯。别担心，资料都是真的。你可以查。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-d2b67ed9c7c4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-d2b67ed9c7c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "后门外。别看前面的车，那不是我开的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-4ab3307265ce",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-4ab3307265ce.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "一直开着。里面不需要开灯，东西也不会坏。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-113d03bdbc9f",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-113d03bdbc9f.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "从你们这里穿过去更近。你不会让我绕路吧。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-f8fc74168c51",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n22-f8fc74168c51.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-cb6b2b44d375.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-117307c80446.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-35e821329aa8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-2b81462e4ec4.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-842e7be60d3c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-6ae7fbd636ba",
