      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-b89af97da100.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "走得慢，零钱也数得慢。你刚上班吧？别紧张，我不催。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-0bea4be9c1ce",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n26-0bea4be9c1ce.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "接孙女回家，路上买些茶和饼干。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-01cffc17fe79",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n26-01cffc17fe79.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "膝盖旧伤，走急了不行。我慢慢挑就好。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-2c751116f6e5",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n26-2c751116f6e5.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "只有我。别着急，我把零钱数清楚。",
      "profile": "N26",
      "clipId": "n26-d008adee8e85",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n26-d008adee8e85.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "edith",
      "speaker": "伊迪丝",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N26",
