    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "我的证件浸过水，换证申请可以查。还有，热饮别放在电器旁边。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-50871948ebb0",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n24-50871948ebb0.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "县医院东楼。我的换证申请也在那里盖过章。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-9d2debce03fe",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n24-9d2debce03fe.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "只有我。返程路上开始结冰，我想买点热的。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-f1db7af89bfe",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n24-f1db7af89bfe.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "热饮别放在电器旁边。我们那边有人因此烫伤过手。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-10f1da4e619b",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n24-10f1da4e619b.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
