    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "骑到这里才发现水快喝完了。广告牌边有人招手，我以为是你们员工。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-1364691f8e76",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-1364691f8e76.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "骑行协会发的，帽檐正好能挡点风雪。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-fa6fb9cf67b9",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-fa6fb9cf67b9.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "车在后面，司机已经卸好待签收的货了。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-524fdccdf846",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-524fdccdf846.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "昨天路过。今天第一次停下来买东西。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-3c016d8bd7a5",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-3c016d8bd7a5.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "owen",
      "speaker": "欧文",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-cb6b2b44d375.wav"
    },
    {
