    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "我知道你今晚一个人。让我进去，剩下的我来做。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-c2bf055c5bb2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-c2bf055c5bb2.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "老板。我们刚通完电话，你不会连他的声音都听不出来吧。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-543ba1d36326",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-543ba1d36326.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "EMP-091。资料是真的，你尽管拿去查。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-6602c61170ce",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-6602c61170ce.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "你一个人。所以我才来替你，你把门开开。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-259ba0b621cf",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-259ba0b621cf.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "老板让我来帮你卸货。把后门打开，我替你搬剩下的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-d486aedb951e",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-d486aedb951e.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
