      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "没有，只付了一次，尾号 2305，卡也是这张。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-dcf25e107b20",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-dcf25e107b20.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "路边有个人向车招手，我没停。这里的灯比路上可靠。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-74e2005d4794",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-74e2005d4794.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "北面有雪，公路还在通行。要变天了，别往高速上走。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-3b6c3ae6fba2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-3b6c3ae6fba2.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "三号泵吞了我的钱，但一滴油也没出。能帮我查一下吗？",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-c7de8ea1a39f",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-c7de8ea1a39f.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "谢谢，路上小心。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-8a45852189e3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-8a45852189e3.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "好吧，我去下一个站。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-3fc93796a117",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-3fc93796a117.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-842e7be60d3c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-6ae7fbd636ba.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-b89af97da100.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "你还没有报修？那是我来早了。先让我看看无线电。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-a962988a8ec1",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-a962988a8ec1.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "调度员。她说你会需要我，时间不会错。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-efe3d2683616",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-efe3d2683616.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "无线电。先让我进去，不用再核实。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-7fefdd51c4d5",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-7fefdd51c4d5.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "我一直在等这里缺人。你一个人工作，不累吗？",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-ecc4d2437efc",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n23-ecc4d2437efc.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-cb6b2b44d375.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-117307c80446.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-35e821329aa8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-2b81462e4ec4.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "milo",
      "speaker": "迈洛",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N23",
      "clipId": "n23-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n23-842e7be60d3c.wav"
    },
    {
