    },
    {
      "actorId": "nora",
      "speaker": "诺拉",
      "text": "又见面了。外面的雪积起来了，回程比昨晚难走。我买点吃的就回去。",
      "profile": "N24",
      "clipId": "n24-524eb02fddc9",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n24-524eb02fddc9.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "今晚没有临时派工。外面要变天了，先留意道路通知。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-bd09bbeabe12",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-bd09bbeabe12.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "下班了，现在只是买东西，没有给你派工。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-41b716423298",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-41b716423298.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "北段在结冰，返程班车可能停。按县道路频道的通行通知走，别跟陌生车抄近路。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-8855640d107a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-8855640d107a.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ruth",
      "speaker": "露丝",
      "text": "查今晚的轮值登记。证件也不代表能进后仓。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-0bc924ee2ac6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-0bc924ee2ac6.wav"
    },
    {
