      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n25-b89af97da100.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "昨天？昨天我没来过。我一直在桥上。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-d9561bdddb6c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-d9561bdddb6c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "我今晚还要回东桥，东桥养护组的人都在等我。",
      "profile": "N25",
      "clipId": "n25-e6f3eacdb246",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n25-e6f3eacdb246.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "june",
      "speaker": "琼",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
