    },
    {
      "actorId": "rowan",
      "speaker": "罗文",
      "text": "你昨晚不是叫人提前来换班吗？我来了。让我进去。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-19fbfb6f1bd8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-19fbfb6f1bd8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "上面还有一间员工室，门没关。我在窗户外看见你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-18ffc688ebf7",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-18ffc688ebf7.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "老板刚叫我的。你不用再打电话。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-4b42756f5c8c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n22-4b42756f5c8c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "上面。你刚才在那里看着我。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-3638dc565843",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-3638dc565843.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "先让我进去。单子明天补给你。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-3e17ea10c63c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n22-3e17ea10c63c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "我还在挑东西。有什么事吗？",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-cb6b2b44d375",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-cb6b2b44d375.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这些就是我挑的商品。麻烦你了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-117307c80446",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-117307c80446.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "我们明晚还会见面。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-35e821329aa8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-35e821329aa8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "你还会需要我的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-2b81462e4ec4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-2b81462e4ec4.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这张多了，我退给你。再算一下剩余的。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-842e7be60d3c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-842e7be60d3c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "这不够吧？麻烦再算一下。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-6ae7fbd636ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-6ae7fbd636ba.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "你多找了。不是这个数。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-b89af97da100",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-b89af97da100.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "wade",
      "speaker": "韦德",
      "text": "还是后面。你的门昨天没有开，今天总该开了。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-5876dfd21306",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n22-5876dfd21306.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "我没再按第二次付款。订单还是待处理，尾号 2406。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-4d5b448429b7",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-4d5b448429b7.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "没有，只付了一次，尾号 2406，卡也是这张。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-1f691ba21cac",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-1f691ba21cac.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ben",
      "speaker": "本",
      "text": "你刚才找我？说老板改了班，让我明晚提前到。",
      "profile": "B21",
      "clipId": "b21-f2a6768570fa",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/b21-f2a6768570fa.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "没有。我一直在店里，没给你打过电话。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-bb6cf58e2469",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-bb6cf58e2469.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "ben",
      "speaker": "本",
      "text": "那声音就是你。你看看店里录像，我先不接受这次调班。",
      "profile": "B21",
      "clipId": "b21-963819984fef",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/b21-963819984fef.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicAlex",
      "speaker": "录像中的声音",
      "text": "本？明晚提前来。老板改了班。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-dbc110d88608",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-dbc110d88608.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "他在学我说话……不是来帮忙的。先报告，别让本过来。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-d3ce58198fec",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-d3ce58198fec.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "骗局被识破了。钱也确实挣到了。再做一班看看。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-db5aad0505c2",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-db5aad0505c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "店已经关了。你是谁？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-1ebf31dbd59d",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-1ebf31dbd59d.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicBen",
      "speaker": "员工服人影",
      "text": "后面的我来，你去忙。",
      "profile": "B21",
      "clipId": "b21-049dbc96ec95",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/b21-049dbc96ec95.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "本今晚不会来。谁让你进来的？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-866b213ea8ad",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-866b213ea8ad.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicBen",
      "speaker": "员工服人影",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "profile": "B21",
      "clipId": "b21-4b4d6b7994f8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/b21-4b4d6b7994f8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "那你为什么用他的声音？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-67b667714d9a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-67b667714d9a.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicAlex",
      "speaker": "录像中的声音",
      "text": "那你为什么用他的声音？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-67b667714d9a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-67b667714d9a.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "它已经进店了。这班我不做了，安排我离开。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-c593a1dba1cb",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-c593a1dba1cb.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "我会把门关好。通路一恢复，立刻通知我。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-122bddc65124",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-122bddc65124.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicAlex",
      "speaker": "录像中的声音",
      "text": "你好，需要什么？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-75a234954686",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-75a234954686.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "它在学我。声音，还有我在柜台上做的事。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-3d7e6a2d3cf4",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-3d7e6a2d3cf4.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "天又黑了。今天不是来上班的，是等着离开。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-226c85e928e6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-226c85e928e6.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicBen",
      "speaker": "员工服人影",
      "text": "亚历克斯，开门。我来接你。",
      "profile": "B21",
      "clipId": "b21-0533537875c8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/b21-0533537875c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "本没有安排来接我。先看监控，再向县里核实。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-f24eecd3aa0a",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-f24eecd3aa0a.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "路刚清出来。再拖一会儿，又得封。车停在后面，出来吧。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-a27e51b6c043",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n22-a27e51b6c043.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "接应说的是前面公交站。你的车呢？",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-2cb74fd3654c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-2cb74fd3654c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "cal",
      "speaker": "卡尔",
      "text": "后面。灯没开，免得看见。",
      "profile": "N22",
      "clipId": "n22-ceffb37b9891",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n22-ceffb37b9891.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "谁看见？我先回拨核实。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-825695426030",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-825695426030.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "外面那个不是来接我的。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-11fb8059a034",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-11fb8059a034.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicAlex",
      "speaker": "录像中的声音",
      "text": "还差一点。三班应该够了。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-a22887d64bc8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-a22887d64bc8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "那是我第一晚说过的话。它一直在听。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-1a48c2589396",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-1a48c2589396.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "至少今晚，不用去上班了。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-c3f9894633f5",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-c3f9894633f5.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "剩下的，换个地方挣。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-428ca04af000",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-428ca04af000.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "mimicAlex",
      "speaker": "录像中的声音",
      "text": "第九出口。这里还有人值班。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-08e44b1d8fe1",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-08e44b1d8fe1.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "还差一点。三班应该够了。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-a22887d64bc8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-a22887d64bc8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "稍等，我把证件还给你。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-021d075d8094",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/a21-021d075d8094.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "稍等，我把付款还给你。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-9330469d0534",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/a21-9330469d0534.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "稍等，我把证件和付款还给你。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-e737a6d475ba",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/a21-e737a6d475ba.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "稍等，我先结束这笔交易。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-c532014ce898",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/a21-c532014ce898.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "它出去了……先把灯弄回来。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-3da115b109a1",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-3da115b109a1.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "灯亮了。回员工室联系老板，我要离开。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-413db9b49820",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-413db9b49820.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "看见车号了。就在原公交站，走前面。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-abae3e0e9ca3",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/a21-abae3e0e9ca3.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "现在走数了。谢谢，我得趁道路还通着赶回去。",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-56174a22db8b",
      "src": "assets/voice/v14/n21-56174a22db8b.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "leon",
      "speaker": "里昂",
      "text": "能来帮我看一下吗？",
      "profile": "N21",
      "clipId": "n21-50034cd32099",
      "src": "assets/voice/v13/n21-50034cd32099.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "天亮了。第一班的钱已经记到账上，离租房首付款还差一些。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-7613146c6549",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-7613146c6549.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "假调班已经取消。本不会过来。睡几个小时，再回来做下一班。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-7b404308929c",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-7b404308929c.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "又到晚上了。先接老板的电话。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-2905b21a07c6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-2905b21a07c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "关店了。道路还封着，今天先在员工室轮休，商店暂停营业。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-aa81c6b92de6",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-aa81c6b92de6.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "天又黑了，商店继续暂停营业。今晚等原道路频道安排安全接应。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-8371c2ad1fd8",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-8371c2ad1fd8.wav"
    },
    {
      "actorId": "alex",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "别开店。先接电话，核实接应的车。",
      "profile": "A21",
      "clipId": "a21-46bf1938cd81",
      "src": "assets/voice/v15/a21-46bf1938cd81.wav"
    }
  ],
